2827 0 obj
<</AP<</N 2829 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Morphology is like studying the building blocks of words. It's all about how words are made and how they work together in a language. We look at how words change to show different things, like if they're plural or past tense. It helps us understand how words are put together and how they make sense in sentences.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 2828 0 R /QuadPoints[ 84 438.25 231 438.25 84 427.25 231 427.25]/Rect[ 84 427.25 231 438.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
endobj
