<</BBox[ 0 0 421.5 74.25]/Filter/FlateDecode/FormType 1/Length 428/Matrix[ 1 0 0 1 0 0]/Resources<</Font<</Helv 701 0 R >>>>/Subtype/Form/Type/XObject>>stream
