3794 0 obj
<</AP<</N 3795 0 R >>/Border[ 0 0 0]/Contents(Plural: It shows when there's more than one of something. For example, adding "-s" to "cat" makes it "cats."\n\nPast Tense: It tells us when something happened in the past. For example, adding "-ed" to "walk" makes it "walked."\n\nComparative: It helps us compare things. For example, adding "-er" to "tall" makes it "taller" when comparing two things.\n\nPossessive: It shows ownership or belonging. For example, adding "'s" to "John" makes it "John's" to show something belongs to John.\n\nProgressive: It indicates ongoing actions. For example, adding "-ing" to "run" makes it "running" to show the action is happening now.)/DA(/Helv 8.25 Tf 0 Tc 9.24 TL 0.8 0 0 rg )/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Rect[ 320.25 31.875 591.75 161.625]/Rotate 0/Subtype/FreeText/Type/Annot>>
endobj
