<</AP<</N 4051 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Grammaticalization is when a word or phrase evolves over time to become part of a language's grammar. It starts as a simple word with a specific meaning but gradually gains new functions, such as indicating tense, aspect, mood, or case. Essentially, it's the process of words becoming more grammatical and less lexical in their usage.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 4050 0 R /QuadPoints[ 129 561.25 228 561.25 129 550.25 228 550.25]/Rect[ 129 550.25 228 561.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
