<</AP<</N 10495 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(it is like a detailed map or guidebook that explains exactly how a language works. It doesn't tell you how the language should work, but rather it describes how people actually use the language in real life.\nImagine you have a guidebook for a city that tells you all the streets, landmarks, and neighborhoods. Descriptive grammar is like that guidebook but for language. It tells you all the rules, structures, and patterns of a language as people naturally speak and write it.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 10494 0 R /QuadPoints[ 97 505.25 195 505.25 97 494.25 195 494.25]/Rect[ 97 494.25 195 505.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
