<</AP<</N 15297 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Perception \(Auditive\): Once sound waves reach our ears, our brain processes and interprets them so we can understand what we hear. Perception involves how we recognize and understand the sounds we hear. For example, when we hear the sound "s," our brain identifies it as the letter "s" and understands its meaning in words.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 15296 0 R /QuadPoints[ 110 637.25 159 637.25 110 626.25 159 626.25]/Rect[ 110 626.25 159 637.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
