42667 0 obj
<</AP<</N 42669 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Okay, let's give it another shot. Linguistic junk is like extra parts from a project that you don't need anymore. They're just there, not really doing anything useful. But instead of throwing them away, sometimes people find clever ways to use these extra parts to build something new. Similarly, in language, there are bits and pieces called morphemes that lose their original meaning or function over time. Instead of being useless, they get repurposed and take on new roles in the language.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 42668 0 R /QuadPoints[ 116 664.25 182 664.25 116 653.25 182 653.25]/Rect[ 116 653.25 182 664.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
