<</AP<</N 43929 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Mass/Count Distinction: This type of polysemy deals with whether we're talking about something as a whole \(mass\) or as individual units \(count\). For example, when we say "I love watermelon," we're talking about watermelon in general, not a specific number of watermelons. But if we say "I sold three watermelons," we're referring to three separate watermelons as individual items.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 43928 0 R /QuadPoints[ 105 423.25 218 423.25 105 412.25 218 412.25]/Rect[ 105 412.25 218 423.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
