<</AP<</N 44118 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(This one is all about what's holding what. Think of a box and what's inside it.Scenario 1: The jar held a delicious cookie.Scenario 2: I devoured the cookie from the jar.In the first scenario, the focus is on the jar containing the cookie. In the second scenario, the focus shifts to the action of eating the cookie, and the jar becomes less important.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 44117 0 R /QuadPoints[ 105 392.25 201 392.25 105 381.25 201 381.25]/Rect[ 105 381.25 201 392.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
