44511 0 obj
<</AP<</N 44513 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Imagine you're watching a play at school. In one scene, you see a student, let's call him Tom, talking to his teacher. In this scene, Tom is the main focus \(the figure\), and the teacher is just part of the background \(the ground\).Now, in the next scene, the focus shifts. Suddenly, the teacher becomes the main character \(the figure\), and Tom is now just part of the background \(the ground\).So, figure-ground reversal is like when the background becomes the main focus, and the main focus becomes part of the background, just like how the teacher and Tom switch roles in different scenes of the play!)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 44512 0 R /QuadPoints[ 90 407.25 196 407.25 90 396.25 196 396.25]/Rect[ 90 396.25 196 407.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
endobj
