<</AP<</N 45494 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(The mental lexicon is like a personal dictionary in your mind. It's where your brain keeps all the information about words: what they mean, how they sound, and how they're used in sentences. It's like having a library of words stored in your head, ready to be accessed whenever you need them to understand or communicate.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 45493 0 R /QuadPoints[ 116 354.25 176 354.25 116 343.25 176 343.25]/Rect[ 116 343.25 176 354.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
