61454 0 obj
<</AP<</N 61456 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Combining Units in a Strange Way:\n\nExample: "international":\nThe prefix "inter-" combines with the word "national" to form "international."\nBut if you try to split it differently, like "inter" + "nation," it doesnt make sense because "internation" isnt a word in English.\nThis shows a mismatch: the formal rule says the prefix should attach to the whole adjective "national," but logically, it feels like it should attach to "nation.")/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 61455 0 R /QuadPoints[ 116 190.25 251 190.25 116 179.25 251 179.25]/Rect[ 116 179.25 251 190.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
