<</AP<</N 61527 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Unit Modifies a Bigger Structure:\nExample: "Vulgar Latinist":\nYou might think it means a Latinist \(a scholar of Latin\) who is vulgar \(rude or crude\).\nBut it actually means someone who studies "Vulgar Latin" \(a form of Latin\).\nHere, the meaning isnt just changing the word "Latinist" but is referring to the specific study of "Vulgar Latin.")/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 61526 0 R /QuadPoints[ 107 717.25 174 717.25 107 706.25 174 706.25]/Rect[ 107 706.25 174 717.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
