<</AP<</N 62558 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Example of "International":The word "international" combines "inter-" \(meaning between\) and "national."According to the rules, "inter-" should attach to "national" directly, but logically, it feels like it should attach to "nation" to mean "between nations."This mismatch is a bracketing paradox because the formal structure \(how we combine the parts\) doesn't match the meaning.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 62557 0 R /QuadPoints[ 302 160.25 432 160.25 302 149.25 432 149.25]/Rect[ 302 149.25 432 160.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
