<</AP<</N 62891 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(A bracketing paradox is when the way we combine parts of words \(like prefixes and suffixes\) according to grammar rules doesn't match up with the meaning we get from those words. It's like having a puzzle where the pieces fit together one way by shape but make a different picture when you look at the whole thing.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 62890 0 R /QuadPoints[ 186 297.25 272 297.25 186 286.25 272 286.25]/Rect[ 186 286.25 272 297.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
