<</AP<</N 69100 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Direct Route: Understand the whole word immediately. \nWhat it means: Recognizing the whole compound word directly.\nHow it works: When you see a compound word like "toothbrush," you immediately recognize it as a single word without breaking it into "tooth" and "brush."\nExample: Think of seeing the word "toothbrush" and instantly knowing its something you use to clean your teeth, without thinking about "tooth" and "brush" separately.\nSpeed: This method is fast because you go straight to the meaning of the whole word.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 69099 0 R /QuadPoints[ 136 573.25 162 573.25 136 562.25 162 562.25]/Rect[ 136 562.25 162 573.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
