<</AP<</N 69215 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Indirect Route: Break the word into parts, understand each part, then combine the meanings.When you see a compound word like "toothbrush," your brain splits it into "tooth" and "brush."You understand what "tooth" means and what "brush" means separately.Then, you combine these meanings to understand "toothbrush."It's like looking at a face and thinking about each feature \(eyes, nose, mouth\) before recognizing the person.This takes a bit longer because you analyze the parts first.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 69214 0 R /QuadPoints[ 175 573.25 245 573.25 175 562.25 245 562.25]/Rect[ 175 562.25 245 573.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
