70480 0 obj
<</AP<</N 70482 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Imagine you have a sentence like "The big brown dog barked loudly." IC analysis is like taking this sentence and breaking it down into smaller and smaller pieces until you can't break them down anymore. These smaller pieces are like building blocks of the sentence, and they're called morphemes. So, you start with the whole sentence, then break it into smaller chunks like "The big brown dog" and "barked loudly," and then keep breaking those down into even smaller parts until you can't break them down anymore. It's like taking apart a puzzle to see how each piece fits together.)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 70481 0 R /QuadPoints[ 131 694.25 183 694.25 131 683.25 183 683.25]/Rect[ 131 683.25 183 694.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
endobj
