<</AP<</N 75332 0 R >>/Border[ 0 0 0]/Contents(Headedness Compound:\n "Headedness" refers to the structural property of a compound where one element is more important or dominant than the other. \n      It emphasizes the asymmetrical relationship between the elements, where one acts as the head and the other as a modifier or specifier.)/DA( /Helv 7.875 Tf 0 Tc 8.82 TL 0 0.466667 0.831373 rg )/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Rect[ 371.25 228 606 281.25]/Rotate 0/Subtype/FreeText/Type/Annot>>
