<</AP<</N 73497 0 R >>/C[ 1 0.941177 0.4]/CA 1/Contents(Headless Compounds: In headless compounds, neither component is clearly more important than the other. Both contribute equally to the overall meaning of the compound. Examples include "toothbrush" and "butterfly."\n)/F 4/PDFIUM_HasGeneratedAP true/Popup 73496 0 R /QuadPoints[ 140 217.25 179 217.25 140 206.25 179 206.25]/Rect[ 140 206.25 179 217.25]/Subtype/Highlight/Type/Annot>>
